t eat"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கோல்","parts":[{"text":"கோல்","lemma":"kōl","gloss":"well-shaped"}],"gloss":"well-shaped"},{"surface":"அமை","parts":[{"text":"அமை","lemma":"amai","gloss":"fitted"}],"gloss":"fitted"},{"surface":"குறும்","parts":[{"text":"குறும்","lemma":"குறும்","gloss":"small"}],"gloss":"small","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தொடி","parts":[{"text":"தொடி","lemma":"toṭi","gloss":"bangle"}],"gloss":"bangle"},{"surface":"தளிர்","parts":[{"text":"தளிர்","lemma":"taḷir","gloss":"tender sprout"}],"gloss":"tender sprout"},{"surface":"அன்னோளே","parts":[{"text":"அன்னோளே","lemma":"அன்னோளே","gloss":"she who is like"}],"gloss":"she who is like","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"In the difficult path lacking water where shade has ceased and disappeared, / as the anklet-wearing hero protects, going in great haste, / near the dried-up mountain pools, boiling and heated, / the very hot muddy water, how did she drink it with a gulp? / How is she capable, she who, in a crafted vessel of pure gold, / even milk mixed with beautiful puffed rice, / would not eat, saying \"it is too much\", / she who is like a tender sprout, wearing well-fitted small bangles?","translation":"She who is like a tender sprout, wearing well-fitted small bangles, used to refuse even milk mixed with beautiful puffed rice served in a crafted vessel of pure gold, saying \"it is too much.\" How is she now capable of going in great haste, protected by her hero wearing warrior anklets, along the difficult path where shade has vanished and water is gone, and drinking with a gulp the hot, boiling, muddy water near the dried-up mountain pools?","modern":"அழகாகச் செய்யப்பட்ட செம்பொன் பாத்திரத்தில், அழகிய பொரியுடன் கலந்த பாலைக் கூட, \"இது எனக்கு அதிகம்\" என்று கூறி உண்ண மறுத்தவள், அழகிய சிறிய வளையல்களை அணிந்த தளிர் போன்ற என் மகள். அவள், வீரக் கழல் அணிந்த தன் தலைவன் தன்னைப் பாதுகாக்க, நிழலும் நீரும் இல்லாத அரிய வழியில் வேகமாகச் சென்று, வற்றிப்போன சுனைகளின் அருகே கொதித்துக் கொண்டிருக்கும் வெப்பமான சேற்று நீரைக் குடிக்க எப்படித்தான் பழகினாளோ?","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the foster-mother (cevili) who is grieving after her daughter eloped with her lover through the harsh desert path (pālai). She contrasts the delicate, pampered life her daughter led at home with the extreme hardships she must now endure. At home, the girl was so delicate that she would refuse even rich milk mixed with puffed rice in a golden bowl, claiming it was too much for her. Now, she is walking rapidly through a waterless, shadeless wilderness under the protection of her young hero. The mother wonders with deep sorrow how this tender girl, who is as soft as a fresh sprout, is able to gulp down the hot, boiling, muddy water found in dried-up mountain pools.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.78],[0.78,1.2],[1.2,1.5],[1.5,1.92],[1.92,2.5],[2.5,3.08],[3.08,3.2],[3.2,4.74],[4.74,4.74],[4.74,5.51],[5.51,5.9],[5.9,5.9],[5.9,7.8],[7.8,8.4],[8.4,8.4],[8.4,8.4],[8.4,8.4],[8.4,8.8],[8.8,9.8],[9.87,10.2],[10.2,11.2],[11.2,11.56],[11.7,12.2],[12.2,12.5],[12.5,13.0],[13.0,13.4],[13.4,13.6],[13.6,14.56],[14.56,15.81],[15.81,15.96],[15.96,16.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.78],[0.78,1.2],[1.2,1.6],[1.6,2.0],[2.0,2.0],[2.0,3.13],[3.13,3.7],[3.7,4.1],[4.1,5.1],[5.1,5.47],[5.47,5.47],[5.47,6.6],[6.6,6.93],[6.93,7.27],[7.27,8.67],[8.67,9.1],[9.63,10.43],[10.43,10.43],[10.43,11.5],[11.58,12.0],[12.0,13.0],[13.0,13.43],[13.6,14.3],[14.35,14.5],[14.5,15.0],[15.0,15.4],[15.4,15.6],[15.6,15.9],[15.9,16.2],[16.2,16.5],[16.5,16.8]]},"sync":[[["நிழல்","shade"],["ஆன்று","having ceased"]],[["ஆன்று","having ceased"],["அவிந்த","disappeared"]],[["நீர்","water"],["இல்","without"]],[["ஆர்","difficult"],["இடை","path"]],[["கழலோன்","anklet-wearing hero"]],[["காப்ப","protecting"],["கடுகுபு","hastening"]],[["கடுகுபு","hastening"]],[["போகி","having gone"]],[["அறு","dried up"],["சுனை","mountain pool"]],[["மருங்கின்","near"]],[["மறுகுபு","boiling"]],[["வெந்த","heated"]],[["வெவ்","hot"],["வெம்","hot"]],[["கலுழி","muddy water"]],[["தவ்வென","gulpingly"],["குடிக்கிய","to drink"]],[["குடிக்கிய","to drink"]],[["யாங்கு","how"]],[["வல்லுநள்","she is capable"],["கொல்","wonder particle"]],[["தானே","herself"]],[["ஏந்திய","held up"]],[["செம்","pure"],["பொன்","gold"]],[["புனை","crafted"],["கலத்து","in the vessel"]],[["கலத்து","in the vessel"],["அம்","beautiful"],["பொரி","puffed rice"],["கலந்த","mixed"]],[["கலந்த","mixed"]],[["பாலும்","even milk"]],[["பல","too much"],["என","thinking"]],[["உண்ணாள்","she would not eat"]],[["கோல்","well-shaped"],["அமை","fitted"]],[["குறும்","small"],["தொடி","bangle"],["தளிர்","tender sprout"]],[["தளிர்","tender sprout"],["அன்னோளே","she who is like"]],[["அன்னோளே","she who is like"]]]}